architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:131:- `npm run test:e2e` from `frontend/`, because project open/save UX is touched by deletion of obsolete project surfaces. This run must use active app-shell/startup/open-project/project-persistence behavior and must not depend on the deleted backend `/api/projects` test path.
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:132:- Playwright/live smoke for app load plus project/startup dialog affordance through the current app shell. If no Google credentials are configured, smoke should verify no-credentials local startup, absence of backend fetch errors, and no expectation that `localhost:3000/api/projects` exists.
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:139:- Shared contract tests proving the single exported `ProjectData`/metadata/serialized-command schema and runtime validators are consumed by both frontend and backend, with no duplicate backend `ProjectDTO` schema or frontend-only contract copy.
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:154:- **Risk: backend deletion is too aggressive if hidden external clients use `/api/projects`.** Project objectives explicitly assign zero weight to backward compatibility and on-disk/source tree is the sole authority; no current frontend usage was found.
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:5:Adopt one explicit backend stance by removing the unused backend project API from the active architecture. The current active project persistence is frontend command-stream `ProjectData` routed through the Wave 009 app-shell runtime and Google Drive ports. The backend stores a stale `ProjectDTO` shape with broad `any` fields and is skipped by root validation. The direct fix is to delete the disconnected backend project API/storage/tests and delete the dead `OpenProjectDialog.vue` component that imports backend source.
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:15:- Obsolete e2e coverage for the removed backend `/api/projects` contract is deleted or replaced with active app-shell/startup/open-project/project-persistence coverage.
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:19:- Backend `ProjectDTO` is not the frontend project contract: it defines `elements2D`, `elements3D`, `dependencyGraph`, `planes`, `hingeLines`, `view2D`, `processTree`, and optional command history with multiple `any` fields (`backend/src/models/Project.ts:6-52`).
architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:22:- The only frontend→backend source import found is in `OpenProjectDialog.vue` (`frontend/src/components/dialogs/OpenProjectDialog.vue:54-58`), but `App.vue` renders `StartupDialog`, not `OpenProjectDialog` (`frontend/src/App.vue:1-16`, `frontend/src/App.vue:91-108`).
